<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Rosa Walton</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我已经等不及你来清理橱柜</text><text for="L2">但现在你准备离开 唯留下一丝印记</text><text for="L3">又一个夜晚 我会静坐着 品读你的言外之意</text><text for="L4">因为我每时每刻都在想念你</text><text for="L5">所以离开吧</text><text for="L6">另一种方式去感知你不愿让自己面对的秘密</text><text for="L7">释放自我吧</text><text for="L8">你知道你不会失去你的自控力</text><text for="L9">让我们于彩虹之上开始吧</text><text for="L10">转身离开吧</text><text for="L11">另一种方法前往你不愿涉足半步的天地</text><text for="L12">释放自我吧</text><text for="L13">这算是选择妥协吗</text><text for="L14">所以你想做什么 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L15">派对即将拉开序幕 你是否愿意参加</text><text for="L16">与你握手问好 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L17">我和你依偎在一起 我不愿离开</text><text for="L18">因为我真心希望待在你的家里</text><text for="L19">我希望梦想能变成现实</text><text for="L20">但你知道你让我伤心欲绝</text><text for="L21">我跟你分道扬镳 我对你视而不见</text><text for="L22">我不想知道</text><text for="L23">我知道你已身陷囹圄</text><text for="L24">因为我竭尽全力 只为陪在你身边</text><text for="L25">所以当你说我就是原因所在 我只是无法相信那些谎言</text><text for="L26">我为什么如此渴望给你打去电话</text><text for="L27">所以你想做什么 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L28">派对即将拉开序幕 你是否愿意参加</text><text for="L29">与你握手问好 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L30">我和你依偎在一起 我不愿离开</text><text for="L31">因为我真心希望待在你的家里</text><text for="L32">我希望梦想能变成现实</text><text for="L33">但你知道你让我伤心欲绝</text><text for="L34">我跟你分道扬镳 我对你视而不见</text><text for="L35">我不想知道</text><text for="L36">我不知道为什么我一无是处</text><text for="L37">所以离开吧</text><text for="L38">另一种方式去感知你不愿让自己面对的秘密</text><text for="L39">释放自我吧</text><text for="L40">你知道你不会失去你的自控力</text><text for="L41">让我们于彩虹之上开始吧</text><text for="L42">转身离开吧</text><text for="L43">另一种方法前往你不愿涉足半步的天地</text><text for="L44">释放自我吧</text><text for="L45">这算是选择妥协吗</text><text for="L46">所以你想做什么 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L47">派对即将拉开序幕 你是否愿意参加</text><text for="L48">与你握手问好 你的看法是什么</text><text for="L49">我和你依偎在一起 我不愿离开</text><text for="L50">因为我真心希望待在你的家里</text><text for="L51">我希望梦想能变成现实</text><text for="L52">但你知道你让我伤心欲绝</text><text for="L53">我跟你分道扬镳 我对你视而不见</text><text for="L54">我不想知道</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="76586484"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="2755337087"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="I Really Want to Stay at Your House"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Samuel Kim"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lorien"/><amll:meta key="album" value="I Really Want to Stay at Your House"/><amll:meta key="album" value="I Really Want to Stay at Your House - Single"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1990743306"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1650546025"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZAKB2202887"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:01.669" end="0:26.850" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:01.669" end="0:05.500" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.669" end="0:01.790">I</span> <span begin="0:01.790" end="0:02.120">could</span><span begin="0:02.120" end="0:02.350">n't</span> <span begin="0:02.350" end="0:02.580">wait</span> <span begin="0:02.580" end="0:02.830">for</span> <span begin="0:02.830" end="0:03.120">you</span> <span begin="0:03.120" end="0:03.220">to</span> <span begin="0:03.220" end="0:03.630">come</span> <span begin="0:03.630" end="0:03.800">and</span> <span begin="0:03.800" end="0:04.090">clear</span> <span begin="0:04.090" end="0:04.200">the</span> <span begin="0:04.200" end="0:04.560">cup</span><span begin="0:04.560" end="0:05.500">boards</span></p><p begin="0:09.151" end="0:12.470" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.151" end="0:09.420">But</span> <span begin="0:09.420" end="0:09.790">now</span> <span begin="0:09.790" end="0:09.940">you're</span> <span begin="0:09.940" end="0:10.300">gon</span><span begin="0:10.300" end="0:10.450">na</span> <span begin="0:10.450" end="0:10.790">leave</span> <span begin="0:10.790" end="0:10.900">with</span> <span begin="0:10.900" end="0:11.160">no</span><span begin="0:11.160" end="0:11.500">thing</span> <span begin="0:11.500" end="0:11.780">but</span> <span begin="0:11.780" end="0:11.840">a</span> <span begin="0:11.840" end="0:12.470">sign</span></p><p begin="0:17.030" end="0:23.260" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.030" end="0:17.090">A</span><span begin="0:17.090" end="0:17.470">no</span><span begin="0:17.470" end="0:17.750">ther</span> <span begin="0:17.750" end="0:17.960">eve</span><span begin="0:17.960" end="0:18.200">ning</span> <span begin="0:18.200" end="0:18.390">I'll</span> <span begin="0:18.390" end="0:18.520">be</span> <span begin="0:18.520" end="0:18.870">sit</span><span begin="0:18.870" end="0:19.120">ting,</span> <span begin="0:19.120" end="0:19.400">rea</span><span begin="0:19.400" end="0:19.650">ding</span> <span begin="0:19.650" end="0:20.330">in</span> <span begin="0:20.330" end="0:20.480">be</span><span begin="0:20.480" end="0:21.310">tween</span> <span begin="0:21.310" end="0:21.540">your</span> <span begin="0:21.540" end="0:23.260">lines</span></p><p begin="0:24.670" end="0:26.850" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.670" end="0:24.800">Be</span><span begin="0:24.800" end="0:25.200">cause</span> <span begin="0:25.200" end="0:25.290">I</span> <span begin="0:25.290" end="0:25.680">miss</span> <span begin="0:25.680" end="0:25.890">you</span> <span begin="0:25.890" end="0:26.100">all</span> <span begin="0:26.100" end="0:26.240">the</span> <span begin="0:26.240" end="0:26.850">time</span></p></div><div begin="0:30.520" end="0:57.946" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:30.520" end="0:32.590" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.520" end="0:31.090">So</span> <span begin="0:31.590" end="0:31.940">get</span> <span begin="0:31.940" end="0:32.080">a</span><span begin="0:32.080" end="0:32.590">way</span></p><p begin="0:32.804" end="0:36.960" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.804" end="0:32.950">A</span><span begin="0:32.950" end="0:33.320">no</span><span begin="0:33.320" end="0:33.540">ther</span> <span begin="0:33.540" end="0:33.800">way</span> <span begin="0:33.800" end="0:33.900">to</span> <span begin="0:33.900" end="0:34.560">feel</span> <span begin="0:34.560" end="0:34.750">what</span> <span begin="0:34.750" end="0:34.960">you</span> <span begin="0:34.960" end="0:35.430">didn't</span> <span begin="0:35.430" end="0:35.710">want</span> <span begin="0:35.710" end="0:35.850">your</span><span begin="0:35.850" end="0:36.350">self</span> <span begin="0:36.350" end="0:36.580">to</span> <span begin="0:36.580" end="0:36.960">know</span></p><p begin="0:37.220" end="0:38.810" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.220" end="0:37.350">And</span> <span begin="0:37.350" end="0:37.600">let</span> <span begin="0:37.600" end="0:37.760">your</span><span begin="0:37.760" end="0:38.310">self</span> <span begin="0:38.310" end="0:38.810">go</span></p><p begin="0:39.871" end="0:43.192" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.871" end="0:40.182">You</span> <span begin="0:40.182" end="0:40.502">know</span> <span begin="0:40.502" end="0:40.682">you</span> <span begin="0:40.682" end="0:41.182">didn't</span> <span begin="0:41.182" end="0:41.502">lose</span> <span begin="0:41.502" end="0:41.622">your</span> <span begin="0:41.622" end="0:42.132">self-</span><span begin="0:42.132" end="0:42.402">con</span><span begin="0:42.402" end="0:43.192">trol</span></p><p begin="0:43.943" end="0:46.452" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.943" end="0:44.422">Let's</span> <span begin="0:44.422" end="0:45.072">start</span> <span begin="0:45.072" end="0:45.232">at</span> <span begin="0:45.232" end="0:45.472">the</span> <span begin